        "summary": "Both Yb3+ and Nd3+ NIR emissions are sensitized by LA2−/LB2−. Relative to [LuNdLu], the Nd3+ lifetime is strongly quenched while Yb3+ emission is retained, giving distributive Nd-to-Yb energy-transfer efficiencies of 87% in MeOH/DMSO solution and 89% in the solid state.",
